1
00:00:00,936 --> 00:00:03,776
(Howard:)-Call him and set up an interview.
-I'm on it.

2
00:00:04,231 --> 00:00:05,611
(Sheldon:)-That's happy, right?
-Yeah.

3
00:00:05,774 --> 00:00:06,944
(Sheldon:)Nailed it.

4
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:10,657
(Prof Laughlin:)Dr. Koothrappali, come on in.

5
00:00:10,862 --> 00:00:13,952
I was surprised to hear you're interested
in joining our team.

6
00:00:14,116 --> 00:00:16,536
(Prof Laughlin:)Giving up on those
trans-Neptunian objects, are we?

7
00:00:16,701 --> 00:00:18,541
(Raj:)No, no. It's a very promising area.

8
00:00:18,703 --> 00:00:20,953
(Raj:)In a perfect world,
I'd spend several more years on it.

9
00:00:21,123 --> 00:00:23,623
I couldn't pass up the opportunity
to work with you...

10
00:00:23,792 --> 00:00:28,092
(Raj:)...on your tremendously exciting and
not yet conclusively disproved hypothesis.

11
00:00:28,255 --> 00:00:30,675
Splendid. Please sit down.

12
00:00:30,882 --> 00:00:32,092
(Prof Laughlin:)Can I offer you a sherry?

13
00:00:32,259 --> 00:00:34,139
(Raj:)It's a little early, isn't it?

14
00:00:34,302 --> 00:00:36,592
Not on Proxima Centauri. Ha, ha.

15
00:00:36,763 --> 00:00:38,013
[CHUCKLING]
Oh, that's very good.

16
00:00:38,181 --> 00:00:43,811
(Raj:)Jolly amusing. But if you don't mind,
I'll hold off until sunset on Titan.

17
00:00:43,979 --> 00:00:47,769
Ha, ha. Well done. I have a feeling
you're going to fit in fine, Dr. Koothrappali.

18
00:00:47,941 --> 00:00:48,981
(Raj:)Thank you, sir.

19
00:00:49,151 --> 00:00:50,191
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

20
00:00:50,777 --> 00:00:52,317
(Woman:)I'm sorry. Am I late?

21
00:00:52,487 --> 00:00:53,817
LAUGHLIN:
No, no. Right on time.

22
00:00:53,989 --> 00:00:57,489
(Prof Laughlin:)Dr. Koothrappali,
may I present Dr. Millstone from MIT.

23
00:00:57,659 --> 00:00:59,659
(Prof Laughlin:)She'll be heading up
our data analysis team.

24
00:00:59,828 --> 00:01:03,018
(Dr Millstone:)It's nice to meet you, Dr. Koothrappali.

